   153	7. **The deployment number.** The log counts **twelve** uses in the Ring (the three lanes singly) and writes *thirteen*. The noon tests are named as left out, in one sentence, and stay unexplained. If the owner would rather the log stop giving a number after the Ring, cut 33:223–227 and the last line of 35:59.
   154	8. **Cael's one sentence to Oryn at the stone** (33:41): that what went up the hill with a light was himself, on purpose. She has seen eight of the nine used; she has not seen Shadow and nothing says that she has. She asks only about his calf. I judged that silence there would have read as a lie to her.
