   171	Her eyes came up to his, level and tired and a little hungry, as they had come up once over three broken ribs.
   172	
   173	"It's closing. I can see it closing. It opened last night and it's half shut, with nothing doing it, the same as those ribs." She reached for clean linen. "You get what a carter gets. Again."
   174	
   175	She bound it in her own cloth, tight and neat, and she put no question to him of any kind.
