   192	## Edge Fauna — PROVISIONAL (Book 7)
   193	
   194	Path-deformed animals; none speak, think or carry a Path. **Stillhounds** — grey, low, silent pack predators that hunt by Path discharge and are nearly blind to a body not using one; they den in quiet ground. **Shale-backs** — armored grazers the size of a cart, placid in herds, lethal on a slope when herded wrong. **The wold-wyrm** — carters' name; singular, enormous, under the Drowned Hall's spring; hunts what stays; never seen whole.
   195	
   196	---
   197	
   198	## Antagonist Ledger
   199	
   200	| Antagonist | Active books | Nature | Fate |
   201	|---|---|---|---|
   202	| Warden Coss | 1-3 | Bureaucratic enforcer, Compact agent | OPEN |
   203	| The Guilds Compact | 3-9 | Institutional system | Collapses (Book 10) |
   204	| Archmarshal Vastin | 4-9 | Compact enforcer → ally | Switches sides (Book 9) |
