202:## 8. Fights and set pieces — planning allowances
206:| M1 | The Thornwater stretch at dusk: a mile with a grey shape at forty-five yards, nobody declaring [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2] | 3,500–4,000 | Tension set piece; no blow struck |
