+## 7. Names
+
+**PASS.** No person, place or animal is newly named. Thornwater, Oxhollow, Fenmark, Ardenmere, Ostrand, Pike, Hesk, Vell, Ephram, Daeva and Reydan are existing canon/plan names; Thornwater's woman, bowman, patients, carters and hounds remain unnamed (`MOVEMENT-005.md:8-9`; `manuscript/chapter-35.md:283-301,363`; `BOOK_MAP.md:160-170`). No owner-supplied name is needed.
+
+## 8. Next-movement inheritance
+
+Movement 6 already carries the telling, birthday, Quieting name, tables, shooting lessons, mule decision, cash after the birthday, string-ban expiry and Oryn's northward window (`MOVEMENT-006.md:20-53`). Its author must additionally inherit these surviving-prose facts:
