**Supporting beats:** Lira 10 (the rim; "mend it at the stone"; "One arm."; the ankle not asked; "Later."; she wants it given; the first mile; the ladder; "Then tell her."; two fingers on his head) · Brom 9 (the box kept; a man with a stick; thirteen feet; the string; "Hand."; six heaps alike; the bread; "What's it cost her?"; "Then it's wrong.") · Karis 11 (a hand on the box; "Thirteen feet."; "Who is last?"; her fists; the wall from her knees; asking nothing; the knot; *Where* and the three words; "I shall fall more carefully."; the two torn leaves; "Wrong.") · Seln 10 (the bow; the jaws; "Back!"; "Nothing." and minding it; the window; the charcoal ring; "I'm not going to draw you one."; "We just told them."; "I shall not be a reason."; "I'd enter both.") · Oryn 14 (the bow she left; "Don't let it shake her."; cloth and knees; "Move."; "Is that calf worse than this arm?"; the hour; the order; "Morning. Wash it."; the noon mendings; what a stop costs; eight crossings; "I saw."; "You get told."; not afraid) · the steading's woman 2 ("Six. Well."; the blanket) · the bowman 2 (the cap; the turned head).

