Twelve. The log (33:203–227) gives each its own line, counts the three lanes singly, and reads *Deployment since the Line: thirteen.* The noon tests and the floor read are left out of the number, and the log says so (33:233) without saying what they were. The second-night log repeats thirteen (35:59). Nothing is used on the 97th–100th: on the table he neither refuses the nine nor lets them answer (37:47–49; "You're helping.", 37:75).

